<title>PHILIPPINES: EEI Corp sets 100 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>EEI Corp sets 100 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>EEI Corp said on Tuesday it is declaring a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the engineering company said the record and payment dates of the dividend will be announced later. Its financial year ends in December.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
